    "updated_at": "2023-11-06T14:53:48Z",
    "body": "`tags` was removed from Gecko in 2008 (Firefox 3), Chromium in 2014 and WebKit in 2017. It was removed from the spec in 2014. That it once existed isn't a good reason to specify it and implement it again. 🙂\r\n\r\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=874084\r\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=169337\r\nhttps://codereview.chromium.org/148693003\r\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=22118",
