    "updated_at": "2023-11-13T05:51:46Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the pointers, I was unaware that it was previously removed.\r\n\r\nI think that was somewhat misguided — for example, [the Blink intent](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/urMtTTPpUro) cited incorrect use counter data, and claimed it was removed in IE11 which was not the case. That said, other decisions were more reasonable, such as Gecko removing it after finding out it was broken without complaints for five years.\r\n\r\nI would be happy to build a case for restoring it by filing impl bugs and/or reimplementing it in at least Servo.",
